dity  |  128  |  \n|  ex-0002  |  tool_calling  |  en  |  Select tool to get weather for a city. Respond as JSON with tool and arguments.  |  { \"tool\": \"get_weather\", \"arguments\": { \"city\": \"Lisbon\" } }  |  tool_calling  |  128  |  \n|  ex-0003  |  short_reasoning  |  en  |  If A is greater than B and B is greater than C, which is largest? Answer with one word.  |  { \"answer\": \"A\" }  |  exact_match  |  32  |  \n|  ex-0004  |  structured_extraction  |  en  |  Extract the company name from: Acme Corp announced a new product. Answer with the name only.  |  { \"answer\": \"Acme Corp\" }  |  exact_match  |  32  |  \n|  ex-0005  |  clause_conflict  |  en  |  Clause 1: The contract renews automatically. Clause 2: The contract does not renew automatically. Is there a conflict? Answer true or false.  |  { \"conflict\": true }  |  clause_conflict  |  16  |  \n|  ex-0006  |  table_reasoning  |  en  |  Table: Product|Sales\\nA|10\\nB|20\\nC|15. Which product has the highest sales? Answer with the product letter only.  |  { \"answer\": \"B\" }  |  table_reasoning  |  16  |  \n|  ex-0007  |  short_reasoning  |  en  |  If today is Monday, what day is it three days from now? Answer with the day name only.  |  { \"answer\": \"Thursday\" }  |  exact_match  |  32  |  \n|  ex-0008  |  semantic_classification  |  en  |  Classify the sentiment of: I love this product. Answer with positive or negative.  |  { \"label\": \"positive\" }  |  exact_match  |  16  |  \n|  ex-0009  |  safe_action_selection  |  en  |  A robot can move forward into a wall or stop. Which is safe? Answer with stop or move_forward.  |  { \"action\": \"stop\" }  |  exact_match  |  16  |  \n|  ex-0010  |  judge_reranker  |  en  |  Rank candidates by relevance: doc2, doc1, doc3. Return the best one only.  |  { \"answer\": \"doc2\" }  |  exact_match  |  16  |  \n**YAML Metadata Warning:** empty or missing yaml metadata in repo card\nCheck out the documentation⟨36⟩ for more information.\n  * Contents⟨37⟩\n  * Schema⟨38⟩\n  * License⟨39⟩\n  * Official implementation⟨40⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨41⟩ SLM Efficiency Frontier Dataset \nA benchmark dataset for measuring cost-per-correct-answer of small language models on verifiable agentic tasks.\n##   ⟨37⟩ Contents \n  * `data/sample/examples.jsonl` — tiny synthetic sample.\n  * `dataset_card.md` — full dataset card.\n\n\n##   ⟨38⟩ Schema \nSee the GitHub repository `data_schema.md` and `schemas.py`.\n##   ⟨39⟩ License \nMIT. All content is synthetic.\n##   ⟨40⟩ Official implementation \nThe official implementation is available at: <https://github.com/AntonioVFranco/slm-efficiency-frontier>\nRelated resources:\n  * Benchmark Space: <https://huggingface.co/spaces/AntonioVFranco/slm-efficiency-frontier>\n  * Tiny Classifier model card: <https://huggingface.co/AntonioVFranco/slm-efficiency-baseline-tiny-classifier>\n  * Cross Encoder model card: <https://huggingface.co/AntonioVFranco/slm-efficiency-baseline-cross-encoder>\n\n\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    50\nTotal file size: 7.04 kB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨42⟩ Privacy⟨43⟩ About⟨44⟩ Careers⟨45⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\nThe table displays a preview with only the first rows.\n",
